#. 6.0/extension.js:221
msgid ""
"Thanks for installing Rounded Corners!\n"
"\n"
"By default no window corners will be rounded until you change the settings "
"to allow it. Open the Rounded Corners settings to either round the corners "
"of all windows by default, or add the applications you want rounded to the "
"inclusion list. You can also adjust the corner radius, and add borders and "
"shadows."
msgstr ""

